    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39655" root="نزب" body-key="n">
    
      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تنازبوا</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تنابزوا</span>. (K.) Accord. to IHsh
and others, this verb has not been heard [from
the Arabs of the classical ages], but only the
subst. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَزَبٌ</span>, which is therefore decided to be a
transp. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبَزٌ</span>. (TA.)

